# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. Phase 1 through Phase 9 are complete. See [docs/phase-9.md](docs/phase-9.md). Phase 10 is typed desks. See [docs/phase-10.md](docs/phase-10.md).

Feature work happens on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 10 turns `trading_accounts` into typed Desks (`desk_type`: Cash and Carry, Perps, Signal follower). Split books that run both C&C and Futures. Do not add a Fly.io worker. Do not call private exchange APIs from the browser. Paper accounts still use the in-app ledger.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture. Do not start DCA, Hyperliquid, or MEXC/XT until Phase 10 is accepted.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of the phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
